C-FOCAL,1969

02.10 S P=0;S D=1
02.20 S P=P+1;S N=P;I (65-P)3.5
02.40 D 8;I (G)0,2.2
02.50 I (A(P)-1)2.2,3.1;S M(D)=101*P-9
02.80 S M(D+1)=M(D)+2;S D=D+2

03.10 S M(D)=101*P+7;D 2.8;G 2.2
03.50 S T=0
03.70 S T=T+1;I (T-D)3.8;I (D-2)12.6;S Q=0;D 11;D 11;G 6.1
03.80 S N=M(T)-FITR(M(T)/100)*100
03.95 D 8;I (-G)4.1,4.6,4.6

04.10 I (A(N))4.2,3.7,4.6
